{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1101919-influence-knowledge","id":1101919,"title":"Influence: Knowledge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-09T04:34:20-07:00","id":1101919,"title":"Influence: Knowledge","content":"How would each level of an Influence like this work? Some basic ideas I had:<br /> <br /> 1) Strengthen - Add a bonus to a skill roll. How large of a bonus would be appropriate? What else can be done with this level?<br /> 2) Manipulate - Add dice tricks to a skill roll?<br /> 3) Control - Move dots in one skill to dots in another? Make someone forget knowledge they possess, or steal knowledge from someone.<br /> 4) Create - Grants dot in a skill or a merit representing a form of knowledge. Grant raw knowledge regarding a topic.<br /> 5) Mass Create - As above, but in multiples<br /> <br /> Any thoughts? Is this way off?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-09T04:56:45-07:00","id":1101927,"title":"","content":"Seems appropiate, but given the modern compartmentalization of knowledge, lesser spirits would likely specialize on specific spheres of knowledge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"M